
NETLOG(1)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            NETLOG(1)

NAME
     netlog - print the last few lines of the network log file

SYNOPSIS
     netlog [ - lines ]

DESCRIPTION
     _N_e_t_l_o_g prints the last few lines of the network log file
     indicating recent network activity.

FILES
     /usr/spool/berknet/logfilethe log

SEE ALSO
     mail(1), net(1), netcp(1), netlpr(1), netmail(1), netq(1),
     netrm(1)

